	(text "J2: link to the main board, rev 2027.01, in the same order as its J4\n(SDA SCL GND 5V 5V GND INT AUDIO). J2 plugs straight onto J4, pin 1 onto pin 1,\nso on this board J2's pin 1 sits at the end away from GPIO 21.\nThe screen owns the Pi's hardware I2C pins, so the main board's I2C runs\nbit-banged (i2c-gpio) on GPIO 10 (SDA) and 11 (SCL). R1/R2 are its pull-ups\nto the Pi's 3.3 V; the main board has none. R3 pulls up the main board's\nopen-drain INT on GPIO 27. Audio stays on GPIO 19 (PWM). GPIO 26 (pin 37)\nis unused. Pins 13, 19, 23, 35 and 37 don't reach the screen."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
